WEBVTT

01:47.920 --> 01:49.040
Don't go.

01:54.780 --> 01:57.060
If you leave, I won't even know
where to look for you.

02:11.940 --> 02:13.080
Come here.

02:14.980 --> 02:16.000
Lie down.

02:36.700 --> 02:37.540
Lie down.

03:56.580 --> 03:57.980
Yesterday, when you were gone…

04:02.020 --> 04:03.360
I was too scared to sleep.

04:04.340 --> 04:05.640
But now…

04:07.700 --> 04:09.140
you brought me home.

04:14.700 --> 04:16.000
This isn't a home.

04:17.600 --> 04:19.160
Just a rented space.

04:21.640 --> 04:22.980
Then, in your mind,

04:25.540 --> 04:26.980
what counts as home?

04:34.700 --> 04:36.180
Anyway, this place isn't it.

04:39.480 --> 04:40.660
Jiang Qiaoxi.

04:42.440 --> 04:44.160
Wherever makes you feel safe

04:46.360 --> 04:47.480
is home.

04:52.100 --> 04:53.460
I'm going to sleep now.

04:53.500 --> 04:54.460
Don't leave.

04:54.960 --> 04:57.260
When I wake up, the first thing I see,

04:57.300 --> 04:58.280
it's going to be you.

04:58.320 --> 04:59.360
Got it?

05:00.140 --> 05:01.620
No leaving.

06:11.560 --> 06:12.920
Jiang Qiaoxi.

06:14.500 --> 06:16.840
Did it hurt…

06:18.820 --> 06:20.140
when these calluses grew?

06:24.680 --> 06:25.760
Yes.

06:34.240 --> 06:35.440
I'm so tired.

07:18.180 --> 07:19.460
Don't do this.

07:24.740 --> 07:26.700
I don't want to wake up so soon.

07:33.440 --> 07:34.620
This is not a dream.

07:46.160 --> 07:47.280
This is not a dream.

08:17.040 --> 08:18.660
Why are you so nervous?

08:19.160 --> 08:20.660
I'm not nervous.

08:25.180 --> 08:26.880
I just had a nightmare.

08:35.480 --> 08:37.140
That wasn't a nightmare.

08:38.780 --> 08:40.340
Did you dream of me

08:40.840 --> 08:42.780
like I always dream of you?

08:44.360 --> 08:46.020
When we're apart,

08:46.060 --> 08:47.320
did you always dream of me?

08:49.980 --> 08:51.020
No.

08:56.000 --> 08:57.540
You love to lie now.

08:58.080 --> 08:59.380
I didn't lie.

09:02.380 --> 09:03.460
Jiang Qiaoxi,

09:05.120 --> 09:06.100
two years ago,

09:07.940 --> 09:09.260
you asked me not to forget you.

09:10.780 --> 09:12.000
I kept my promise.

09:14.180 --> 09:15.440
So now,

09:15.940 --> 09:17.800
you have no reason to reject me.

12:41.880 --> 12:43.020
Jiang Qiaoxi.

12:44.800 --> 12:46.000
I'm going to…

12:46.940 --> 12:48.480
visit your cousin and sis-in-law tomorrow.

12:56.580 --> 12:58.360
Go back and get some proper rest.

12:59.800 --> 13:01.100
Tomorrow, you should leave.

13:01.600 --> 13:02.580
There's no need to go see them.

13:06.660 --> 13:08.460
Of course it's necessary!

13:09.460 --> 13:12.600
The lipstick and heels you gave me

13:13.400 --> 13:15.000
were all picked by sis-in-law.

13:15.040 --> 13:17.920
Now that I'm in Hong Kong, I have to visit

13:18.420 --> 13:19.780
and thank her in person.

13:23.040 --> 13:25.060
I have no contact with them anymore.

13:26.600 --> 13:28.780
Jiang Qiaoxi, what are you so afraid of?

13:28.820 --> 13:30.360
Why can't you just tell me the truth?

13:35.420 --> 13:36.320
Not the time yet.

13:48.760 --> 13:50.820
I am not qualified
to tell you what I'm afraid of.

13:52.540 --> 13:54.680
Then when?

13:54.720 --> 13:56.420
What's the qualification you need?

13:57.120 --> 13:59.680
Why obsess over the concept
of doing it at the right time?

13:59.720 --> 14:00.780
Even as a kid,

14:01.320 --> 14:02.280
you waited,

14:02.320 --> 14:03.780
endured, held up,

14:03.820 --> 14:06.060
until you had leverage
to negotiate with your mom.

14:06.100 --> 14:08.560
You need to survive the Olympiad
to have the right to rebel.

14:08.600 --> 14:10.660
You need to study abroad to claim freedom.

14:11.160 --> 14:13.260
Now you're pushing me away again

14:13.300 --> 14:15.780
because you think everything
must be perfectly prepared

14:15.820 --> 14:17.160
before moving forward, right?

14:17.700 --> 14:19.880
But the world isn't a math problem.

14:19.920 --> 14:21.460
You can't wait for all the answers

14:21.500 --> 14:23.180
to be ready before starting the exam.

14:24.740 --> 14:26.020
Well, I don't work like that.

14:26.520 --> 14:27.620
My family never did either.

14:31.080 --> 14:32.260
Then tell me.

14:34.180 --> 14:35.680
How does the Lin family do it?

14:36.580 --> 14:37.720
In my family,

14:38.220 --> 14:40.520
we are in this together.

14:41.940 --> 14:43.360
Jiang Qiaoxi,

14:43.400 --> 14:45.380
no one needs to be perfect

14:45.420 --> 14:47.360
because it's impossible.

14:48.060 --> 14:49.560
Humans can't always
be at peak performance,

14:49.600 --> 14:50.560
can't always win,

14:50.600 --> 14:51.960
can't always excel.

14:58.220 --> 14:59.820
I don't need to be perfect.

15:01.900 --> 15:03.180
I know that.

15:03.220 --> 15:04.860
I'll never be perfect in this lifetime.

15:06.820 --> 15:08.960
But Lin Yingtao, can't you see?

15:09.000 --> 15:11.300
I don't want you suffering with me.

15:12.300 --> 15:13.720
And I know you.

15:13.760 --> 15:15.540
If I were living easily,

15:15.580 --> 15:17.140
you might not stay.

15:18.460 --> 15:20.380
But if I'm in the gutter,

15:21.260 --> 15:23.300
you'd crawl in beside me
without a second thought.

15:32.520 --> 15:33.560
Then aren't you…

15:36.520 --> 15:38.480
afraid that I'll really forget you?

15:43.460 --> 15:44.900
What's worth remembering…

15:47.860 --> 15:49.400
about me like this?

15:50.760 --> 15:53.420
The Jiang Qiaoxi you should remember
isn't the one standing here now.

16:09.800 --> 16:11.680
You're circling back again.

16:11.720 --> 16:15.100
You still want me
to remember the outstanding you,

16:15.600 --> 16:16.980
the high-achieving you.

16:17.020 --> 16:18.700
Lin Yingtao, I'm not like you.

16:20.440 --> 16:21.880
I'm empty.

16:22.560 --> 16:24.300
If I am not outstanding anymore,

16:24.340 --> 16:26.200
what's left in me for you to love?

16:33.280 --> 16:34.460
Jiang Qiaoxi.

16:35.640 --> 16:37.180
Do you really think you won

16:37.220 --> 16:38.840
that battle with your mom as a kid?

16:42.740 --> 16:44.520
It was a fake victory.

16:44.560 --> 16:46.140
Your whole life, you've begged us

16:46.180 --> 16:47.820
to love you as you are.

16:50.000 --> 16:51.680
But do you even know…

16:52.800 --> 16:54.660
who that is?

16:56.220 --> 16:57.580
Do you accept him?

16:58.940 --> 17:00.440
Love him?

17:00.940 --> 17:04.240
You're just trying
to slap a halo on your true self

17:04.740 --> 17:06.540
so you'll feel…

17:07.500 --> 17:08.839
you are worthy of love.

17:12.560 --> 17:14.819
That's the toxic root of your life.

17:15.540 --> 17:17.200
It's killing you.

17:19.180 --> 17:20.720
And it's killing us.

17:29.260 --> 17:30.500
Can someone as good as you…

17:34.460 --> 17:37.140
truly accept me when I'm nothing?

17:40.460 --> 17:42.780
To you, I'm not that great.

17:46.200 --> 17:48.200
You underestimate me, Jiang Qiaoxi.

17:51.400 --> 17:52.980
You think my love is something

17:54.680 --> 17:56.620
you have to earn with achievements.

17:58.300 --> 17:59.760
But here's the truth.

17:59.800 --> 18:01.340
Once I made up my mind to love you,

18:01.380 --> 18:02.900
I'll love you till the end.

18:04.960 --> 18:06.520
Your excellence

18:07.740 --> 18:09.760
won't make me love you more.

18:11.000 --> 18:12.320
Your ordinariness

18:13.600 --> 18:15.460
won't make it less.

18:25.720 --> 18:26.980
Wait for me a little longer.

18:31.880 --> 18:33.360
I will come for you.

18:39.020 --> 18:40.580
Jiang Qiaoxi, I want to date.

18:40.620 --> 18:41.860
I want someone to be there.

18:41.900 --> 18:44.280
I'm tired of calling numbers
that never pick up,

18:44.320 --> 18:45.760
texting into the void.

18:45.800 --> 18:47.160
Whatever.

18:47.200 --> 18:50.280
It's not like
you're the only one I've ever liked.

18:50.320 --> 18:51.660
I can move on too.

18:53.280 --> 18:55.480
Back in school, no early dating.

18:55.520 --> 18:57.440
Now you claim you've got nothing.

18:57.480 --> 18:58.800
What's next?

18:58.840 --> 19:00.660
What excuse comes after?

19:01.160 --> 19:03.420
Even if I wait, when will it end?

19:05.080 --> 19:06.620
Every time it rains in Hongyang,

19:06.660 --> 19:07.560
I wonder,

19:07.600 --> 19:09.340
where are you? Did you bring an umbrella?

19:09.380 --> 19:10.660
When the wind howls, I panic

19:10.700 --> 19:12.260
and think if you are safe.

19:12.760 --> 19:15.540
If I see a car crash, my brain screams.

19:15.580 --> 19:17.880
What if that was you? How would you cope?

19:17.920 --> 19:19.600
But I don't know. I really don't.

19:19.640 --> 19:21.100
And I can't keep doing this.

19:21.140 --> 19:23.220
Here I am, alone, missing you,

19:23.720 --> 19:25.260
without even your number to call.

19:25.300 --> 19:26.440
I can't do this anymore.

19:27.380 --> 19:28.420
You told me

19:28.460 --> 19:29.900
to remember you forever.

19:30.400 --> 19:32.580
Well, I did. And what's the point?

19:33.120 --> 19:35.020
At ten, I could wait and survive

19:35.060 --> 19:36.140
by thinking about you.

19:36.180 --> 19:37.580
But I'm 20 now.

19:38.680 --> 19:40.180
I can't stay a child.

19:40.220 --> 19:42.680
I can't keep doing stupid things.

19:42.720 --> 19:44.060
How long should I wait for you?

19:44.600 --> 19:45.840
Until I start dating someone else?

19:45.880 --> 19:47.060
Until I get married?

19:47.100 --> 19:49.040
Or until I have my own family?

19:49.080 --> 19:50.960
By then, shall I still remember you,

19:51.800 --> 19:53.520
the outstanding Jiang Qiaoxi?

19:54.600 --> 19:55.900
Would it even mean anything anymore?

19:59.160 --> 20:00.140
Jiang Qiaoxi.

20:01.120 --> 20:02.780
I've decided to stop loving you.

20:04.580 --> 20:05.740
You don't need to earn

20:05.780 --> 20:07.960
my love with your achievements
and glory anymore.

20:08.780 --> 20:10.300
If you truly crave the attention,

20:12.460 --> 20:14.420
then go fight for it
wholeheartedly, for yourself.

20:18.880 --> 20:19.900
I'm leaving now.

21:04.000 --> 21:05.620
No more

21:05.660 --> 21:07.360
unanswered calls.

21:08.320 --> 21:10.660
No more texts left on read.

21:11.780 --> 21:13.220
No more worrying about you.

21:41.300 --> 21:47.740
FOOT HEALTH
PLEASE PROCEED UPSTAIRS FROM HERE

22:45.200 --> 22:46.460
Wait a second, sir.

23:06.300 --> 23:07.520
Drive on.

23:22.160 --> 23:23.140
Yingtao!

23:26.620 --> 23:27.820
Yingtao!

24:51.940 --> 24:56.440
Jiang Qiaoxi!

25:10.240 --> 25:11.920
I saw you chasing after me,

25:12.420 --> 25:14.800
but I told the driver to take a detour
before coming back.

25:16.380 --> 25:18.360
I wanted you to know

25:19.180 --> 25:20.500
how it feels to be a seeker.

25:37.720 --> 25:40.240
Two years ago,
you told me not to forget you,

25:41.180 --> 25:42.180
then you ran away.

25:43.180 --> 25:44.340
Just now, when I left,

25:44.380 --> 25:45.360
you chased after me again.

25:46.480 --> 25:47.920
What exactly do you want from me?

25:59.360 --> 26:00.260
Yingtao,

26:01.080 --> 26:02.240
please don't stop loving me.

26:05.740 --> 26:07.060
I can't bear to lose you.

26:12.660 --> 26:13.800
What do you mean?

26:15.280 --> 26:16.920
I want the exact answer.

26:17.680 --> 26:20.060
I won't give you
another chance to be vague.

26:21.240 --> 26:22.380
I hate ambiguity.

26:25.740 --> 26:26.920
I…

26:30.780 --> 26:31.860
I…

26:31.900 --> 26:33.340
I can't live without you.

26:34.580 --> 26:36.380
Could you please not leave?

26:38.160 --> 26:40.500
I don't want to see you
dating someone else.

26:41.680 --> 26:43.320
I don't want…

26:43.360 --> 26:44.540
you marrying someone else.

26:45.760 --> 26:47.680
I can't accept that everything between us

26:47.720 --> 26:48.960
meant nothing.

26:57.880 --> 26:59.180
Lin Yingtao.

26:59.680 --> 27:01.440
Thank you for remembering me.

27:01.480 --> 27:03.060
I love you.

27:03.100 --> 27:05.480
I, Jiang Qiaoxi,
want to be your boyfriend.

27:06.020 --> 27:08.200
Say it exactly like this, word for word.

27:15.660 --> 27:16.660
Lin Yingtao.

27:17.920 --> 27:19.800
Thank you for remembering me.

27:21.780 --> 27:22.880
I love you.

27:25.380 --> 27:26.740
From this moment on,

27:28.380 --> 27:29.760
I, Jiang Qiaoxi,

27:30.260 --> 27:31.620
am officially your boyfriend.

27:34.380 --> 27:36.320
- I…
- Let me think about this.

27:36.360 --> 27:38.220
We can't have it as you wish, can we?

27:44.580 --> 27:45.720
Yingtao.

27:47.440 --> 27:49.200
Could you be my girlfriend?

27:51.480 --> 27:52.320
I'll think about it.

28:05.860 --> 28:07.040
Have you made a decision?

28:11.640 --> 28:13.320
Truth is, I hold grudges.

28:13.900 --> 28:15.740
I've imagined so many times

28:15.780 --> 28:17.300
about you showing up one day,

28:17.340 --> 28:18.820
saying these words to me.

28:18.860 --> 28:20.320
I will resent you for a long,

28:20.360 --> 28:21.840
long time before I ever forgive you.

28:26.340 --> 28:28.200
I know you're angry with me,

28:28.240 --> 28:29.300
and I know

28:29.800 --> 28:31.000
it'll take you long to forgive me.

28:34.560 --> 28:36.680
Because even I can hardly forgive myself.

28:38.380 --> 28:40.000
Are you stupid?

28:40.040 --> 28:42.320
Why are you just agreeing with me?

28:42.360 --> 28:44.320
Shouldn't you be pulling me

28:44.360 --> 28:46.260
into your arms right now?
Then I'd push you away,

28:46.300 --> 28:47.140
hit you a couple of times,

28:47.180 --> 28:49.260
and you'd hold me tighter
and never let go.

28:49.300 --> 28:51.020
That's how I'd finally
become your girlfriend.

28:51.940 --> 28:52.820
Stop hugging me.

28:56.060 --> 28:57.060
Don't go.

29:02.960 --> 29:04.120
Don't leave me.

29:18.100 --> 29:19.260
Fine.

29:22.060 --> 29:24.760
I'm only forgiving you

29:25.260 --> 29:26.900
because you seem truly sorry.

29:29.400 --> 29:30.700
So…

29:33.320 --> 29:34.860
I guess this means

29:35.940 --> 29:36.840
I'm your girlfriend now.

29:38.900 --> 29:39.740
‪Okay.

30:17.940 --> 30:19.100
Go back for now.

30:20.440 --> 30:21.620
It's late. Time to sleep.

30:22.160 --> 30:23.560
I don't want to sleep.

30:24.720 --> 30:26.220
The weather's so nice.

30:27.840 --> 30:28.920
Let's do something else.

30:33.180 --> 30:35.380
No way.
You just recovered from being sick.

30:35.880 --> 30:37.580
You need proper rest.

30:37.620 --> 30:40.040
I took my meds,
and I napped all afternoon.

30:40.080 --> 30:41.520
I'm full of energy now.

30:43.020 --> 30:44.580
But you were working all day without rest.

30:44.620 --> 30:45.920
Can't keep up?

30:46.420 --> 30:47.840
Damn right I can keep up.

30:48.540 --> 30:50.740
It's settled then. Tonight is…

30:51.500 --> 30:53.800
officially our first date.

30:53.840 --> 30:55.860
You'd better show me
around Hong Kong properly.

30:55.900 --> 30:57.760
Make up for breaking my heart.

31:02.840 --> 31:04.800
Deal. Date night starts now.

31:07.280 --> 31:09.380
- Suitcase.
- I forgot it.

31:55.720 --> 31:58.840
KEEP LEFT

31:58.880 --> 32:01.980
CHEUNG PO TSAI

32:12.140 --> 32:13.180
What are you smiling about?

32:14.640 --> 32:16.640
I smiled because you were smiling.

32:18.680 --> 32:20.460
What's making you grin this time?

32:22.120 --> 32:23.940
Just suddenly remembered,

32:25.400 --> 32:27.240
at 17,

32:27.740 --> 32:29.820
we had to hide in alleyways

32:30.560 --> 32:32.060
to eat jujube buns at school,

32:32.560 --> 32:33.860
scared of getting caught.

32:35.620 --> 32:38.300
Here we are, having snacks on street,

32:38.340 --> 32:40.140
open and aboveboard,

32:40.880 --> 32:42.460
acting like…

32:46.460 --> 32:47.780
some cheesy drama couple.

32:53.980 --> 32:55.100
From now on,

32:56.280 --> 32:58.260
no one will stand in our way.

33:00.600 --> 33:01.780
No distance

33:02.660 --> 33:04.040
we can't cross.

33:06.860 --> 33:07.840
Damn right.

33:08.620 --> 33:10.640
Nothing can stop us now.

33:14.180 --> 33:15.240
Growing up is so nice.

33:17.860 --> 33:19.340
Not because of growing up.

33:20.240 --> 33:21.700
It was your courage

33:22.400 --> 33:24.260
that vanquished every barrier.

33:25.000 --> 33:26.060
Damn right I am.

33:26.560 --> 33:27.440
Impressed yet?

33:28.940 --> 33:30.340
Matchless valor!

33:38.540 --> 33:39.600
Jiang Qiaoxi.

33:40.580 --> 33:41.480
I…

33:42.240 --> 33:43.260
I'm full now,

33:43.760 --> 33:45.200
feeling healthier.

33:45.700 --> 33:47.300
My mood…

33:47.340 --> 33:48.360
has improved.

33:48.400 --> 33:50.780
So, tell me everything

33:51.540 --> 33:53.340
I've missed these years.

34:02.280 --> 34:03.660
Remember

34:04.680 --> 34:06.760
when you first heard
I was studying abroad?

34:07.640 --> 34:08.980
You told me,

34:10.940 --> 34:12.080
"A roc spreads its wings,

34:12.580 --> 34:13.920
boundless horizons await.

34:13.960 --> 34:16.780
You'll achieve great things."

34:19.860 --> 34:20.940
But…

34:21.440 --> 34:23.400
I couldn't even accomplish

34:24.420 --> 34:25.600
the smallest things.

34:31.600 --> 34:32.860
Not long after I arrived here…

34:33.800 --> 34:35.480
…the subprime mortgage crisis hit.

34:35.980 --> 34:37.940
My parents lost a fortune over stocks.

34:37.980 --> 34:39.820
They were getting divorced
and had no time for me.

34:39.860 --> 34:41.860
My cousin, in the finance industry,

34:42.360 --> 34:44.000
of course, got hit hard too.

34:44.500 --> 34:46.600
But at first,

34:47.100 --> 34:50.239
he still tried to cover
all my living expenses abroad.

34:51.320 --> 34:52.320
Cousin,

34:52.360 --> 34:53.940
must you be so stubborn?

34:53.980 --> 34:56.960
I've lived through enough financial storms
here in Hong Kong.

34:57.000 --> 34:58.440
I am confident

34:58.480 --> 35:00.040
that we'll survive this.

35:00.080 --> 35:01.820
So what if they cut my pay?

35:01.860 --> 35:04.000
Been there, done that.

35:04.900 --> 35:06.480
I've got savings. I'm fine.

35:07.220 --> 35:08.760
You're just a kid.

35:08.800 --> 35:10.080
Stop worrying about

35:10.120 --> 35:11.720
grown-up problems.

35:11.760 --> 35:13.720
Focus on your studies, live your life.

35:13.760 --> 35:16.000
Stop pretending, cousin.

35:16.960 --> 35:19.400
You can't just cancel your insurance

35:19.440 --> 35:20.840
for Uncle and Aunt's retirement funds.

35:20.880 --> 35:22.300
What if someday you…

35:23.820 --> 35:25.660
Your sis-in-law and I
are strong and healthy.

35:25.700 --> 35:27.200
Healthier than you, mind you.

35:27.960 --> 35:30.480
Even if we need
to renew the insurance later,

35:30.520 --> 35:32.220
that's always an option.

35:32.260 --> 35:34.700
Anyway, don't think about dropping out.

35:35.200 --> 35:36.420
We can't let it happen.

35:36.460 --> 35:38.200
With your grades,

35:38.240 --> 35:40.960
landing a full scholarship
won't be a problem at all.

35:41.000 --> 35:42.320
That scholarship?

35:42.360 --> 35:44.860
Definitely something for you
in the future.

35:44.900 --> 35:47.500
If you graduate early and start working,

35:47.540 --> 35:50.500
when I get fired, I'll be counting

35:50.540 --> 35:51.660
on you to support me.

35:51.700 --> 35:53.300
I am not joking. It's true.

35:54.360 --> 35:56.880
Just focus on your studies.
After graduation,

35:56.920 --> 35:59.880
our family will have double safeguards.

36:01.060 --> 36:02.140
Think about it.

36:09.540 --> 36:10.560
Alright.

36:11.300 --> 36:12.260
Cousin,

36:12.760 --> 36:14.100
I'll work harder,

36:14.140 --> 36:15.380
graduate early

36:15.420 --> 36:16.340
to help you out.

36:16.380 --> 36:18.440
That's good, kid.

36:18.940 --> 36:21.380
Took me long to make sense to you.

36:21.420 --> 36:22.420
Come on.

36:28.420 --> 36:29.660
Talked until my mouth went dry.

36:29.700 --> 36:30.840
Jiang Ruocheng.

36:31.340 --> 36:33.040
Security wouldn't let me upstairs.

36:33.080 --> 36:35.120
Said I'm not with the company anymore.

36:35.160 --> 36:37.900
Just answer me one thing. Why fire me?

36:37.940 --> 36:38.900
Don't talk here.

36:39.780 --> 36:40.620
Don't act rashly.

36:40.660 --> 36:41.980
I'll go talk to him.

36:42.020 --> 36:43.800
I'll be right back.
Keep eating. It's fine.

36:44.340 --> 36:46.080
My cousin is 16 years old than me.

36:46.860 --> 36:48.280
He carried me to kindergarten,

36:48.780 --> 36:50.060
taught me to write.

36:50.100 --> 36:51.720
Even when drowning himself,

36:51.760 --> 36:54.380
he scraped together to fund my education.

36:54.420 --> 36:56.020
Because he knew that

36:56.060 --> 36:58.860
I couldn't survive home with my parents.

37:13.200 --> 37:14.340
But…

37:16.360 --> 37:18.300
- he was pushed off the building.
- Cousin!

37:19.820 --> 37:21.700
Cousin!

37:27.700 --> 37:29.440
Cousin is in the ICU.

37:29.480 --> 37:31.880
We paid countless medical bills.

37:31.920 --> 37:33.720
The compensation payout can't cover them.

37:33.760 --> 37:35.840
If only we hadn't canceled
his health insurance.

37:37.840 --> 37:38.940
Sis-in-law

37:39.440 --> 37:40.740
had to sell their flat.

37:42.760 --> 37:44.560
Bad timing. The market crashed,

37:44.600 --> 37:47.180
so it went for peanuts.

37:47.220 --> 37:48.340
But what choice did we have?

37:49.180 --> 37:50.560
If we kept it,

37:50.600 --> 37:51.980
we couldn't pay the hospital.

37:53.640 --> 37:55.680
Tears streaming down her face,
she whispered,

37:55.720 --> 37:56.840
"I'm sorry.

37:56.880 --> 37:58.720
We have to use your education fund."

38:01.820 --> 38:03.220
I told her

38:03.260 --> 38:04.640
I'd cancel my studies.

38:05.540 --> 38:06.900
She refused.

38:06.940 --> 38:08.820
So, I planted myself in Hong Kong.

38:09.320 --> 38:10.540
Let every offer letter

38:10.580 --> 38:12.140
expire in my hands.

38:12.180 --> 38:13.440
I wasn't leaving.

38:13.480 --> 38:15.720
DUE TO FAMILY CIRCUMSTANCES
I AM UNABLE TO ATTEND SCHOOL

38:17.540 --> 38:18.660
Without money,

38:19.280 --> 38:20.800
they can't stay in that

38:20.840 --> 38:22.220
top-tier nursing home.

38:22.260 --> 38:23.460
Uncle deteriorated rapidly

38:23.500 --> 38:24.580
these past months.

38:25.080 --> 38:26.720
He barely remembers

38:26.760 --> 38:28.640
anyone or anything.

38:38.960 --> 38:39.900
At the end,

38:39.940 --> 38:41.560
she tried and asked cousin's senior,

38:41.600 --> 38:43.340
his best friend Xu Wenzhou,

38:43.840 --> 38:45.400
a HKU grad too.

38:46.880 --> 38:47.880
Qiaoxi.

38:50.460 --> 38:52.760
Senior Xu took me to see the president,

38:53.260 --> 38:54.860
with my academic records in one hand,

38:54.900 --> 38:56.420
cousin's medical bills in the other.

38:56.960 --> 38:58.260
We pleaded with him

38:58.820 --> 38:59.800
that

38:59.840 --> 39:01.460
I can defer my admission to HKU

39:01.500 --> 39:02.940
for one year,

39:03.440 --> 39:05.820
so I can earn enough
to keep the family going.

39:07.960 --> 39:09.100
Take your time.

39:09.140 --> 39:10.300
Take your time. Stay safe.

39:22.260 --> 39:23.880
In lucid moments,

39:23.920 --> 39:25.140
my past

39:25.180 --> 39:26.620
feels like

39:26.660 --> 39:28.200
some vast dream.

39:29.840 --> 39:31.400
But in the haze between sleep and sober,

39:31.900 --> 39:34.560
I often lose all sense of place.

39:45.560 --> 39:46.740
Take an apple back with you.

39:47.620 --> 39:48.740
Go on. Take it.

39:48.780 --> 39:50.400
And eat it yourself, you hear?

40:01.840 --> 40:03.040
Back then,

40:03.080 --> 40:04.680
I stopped replying.

40:06.980 --> 40:07.980
Because

40:08.480 --> 40:10.320
I couldn't even muster the courage

40:11.120 --> 40:12.300
to read your messages.

41:11.900 --> 41:13.600
When I hit rock bottom,

41:14.240 --> 41:15.540
I finally knew

41:15.580 --> 41:17.880
under what circumstances a person

41:18.940 --> 41:20.500
could write down such brutal poems.

41:21.940 --> 41:24.820
"The drunken path lies smooth.
Visit often, my friend.

41:26.140 --> 41:29.800
All other roads lead to ruin in the end."

41:31.300 --> 41:33.080
How can you describe it

41:34.020 --> 41:36.520
as you haven't achieved
even the smallest things?

41:39.360 --> 41:40.800
What you've done

41:42.460 --> 41:44.380
outshines any vast odyssey.

41:45.740 --> 41:47.480
These were things I should have done.

41:48.860 --> 41:50.040
And still,

41:51.280 --> 41:53.060
I bungled them all.

41:53.100 --> 41:54.660
That same day,

41:56.260 --> 41:58.440
my landlord threw me out.

41:58.480 --> 41:59.920
An apartment like a coffin.

42:00.420 --> 42:01.600
Walls so close,

42:01.640 --> 42:03.180
I could touch both sides at once.

42:03.900 --> 42:05.640
I rented it cheap

42:05.680 --> 42:07.640
because I was in haste.

42:08.180 --> 42:10.240
Only realizing it was a shell game
when the landlord came.

42:11.140 --> 42:12.560
I was scammed

42:12.600 --> 42:14.540
by the middleman from day one.

42:16.120 --> 42:17.260
Isn't it ironic?

42:18.280 --> 42:20.060
I always thought I was so clever.

42:20.100 --> 42:22.660
But when it comes to reality,

42:24.060 --> 42:25.400
I was at a total loss mostly.

42:28.060 --> 42:30.080
And after that day,

42:30.120 --> 42:31.220
what did you do?

42:31.820 --> 42:33.040
After that…

42:37.680 --> 42:39.360
I just shouldered my bag…

42:41.360 --> 42:42.520
and walked here.

42:43.980 --> 42:45.020
Stood here,

42:45.520 --> 42:47.240
under this sky of burning sunset.

42:48.520 --> 42:50.500
For the first time, I prayed in my heart.

42:51.000 --> 42:52.820
Let the day in Hongyang

42:54.140 --> 42:56.800
be a cloudy day without sunset glows.

42:57.800 --> 42:59.700
Yingtao must not see the sunset glow.

43:00.380 --> 43:02.020
So she won't think of me.

43:02.060 --> 43:03.860
Let her be happy…

43:06.440 --> 43:07.560
even just a little.

45:30.200 --> 45:33.000
Subtitle translation by: Wanjiao Song
